Bundled fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

templates/shared/fonts/ contains signed-distance-field glyphs generated from the
Noto Sans typeface (Regular, Bold and Italic). Map labels are drawn from glyphs
rather than from fonts installed on a reader's machine, so these travel with the
software and are redistributed with it.

